Package: wiki.qaq.unfaird
Name: unfaird (iPhone 15)
Version: 0.1.15
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Asspp on-device IPA decrypt daemon for iPhone 15 family.
 Profile: iOS 17.3, Dopamine 2 rootless, A16/arm64e target, builtin process dump.
 Requires on device: OpenSSH, AppSync Unified, appinst, ElleKit and libjailbreak.dylib.
 Default policy: compatible extensions, batch size 8, 512 MB Jetsam limit.
Section: Utilities
Maintainer: LiBr <me@nvme0n1p.dev>
Author: LiBr <me@nvme0n1p.dev>
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0)
Provides: wiki.qaq.assppweb
Replaces: wiki.qaq.assppweb
